title: Authorizations › New case › Review and sign › The draft and the summary
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId (step 4 of 4, 'Ready for your signature')
intro: Step 4 shows what the payer will read: the medical-necessity summary Scribe drafted, which can be edited, with a chip for every chart page it came from. It is the same summary the case page's Draft tab shows: an edit made in either place is read in the other. The validation summary, the checks and the signing card are in the next two diagrams.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Review and sign' on step 3\nOr 'Review and sign' on a ready case in Case Manager"
screen sc "Ready for your signature\n'Nothing goes to the payer until a clinician signs.'\nStepper: 'Review and sign' current"

group gLayout "Layout"
  screen sL "Left column\nMedical-necessity summary, then Validation summary"
  screen sR "Right column\nChecks, Approval chance, Sign and send"
  screen sF "Footer bar\n'Back', 'Save as draft'"
endgroup

screen sNarr "Medical-necessity summary\n'What Summit will read · every statement links to the chart'\nFour sections: Clinical picture, level of care reason, Current severity, Plan"
process pCtx "A fifth paragraph 'Context added.' shows when notes were added on the case page\n(Add clinical context, Recommended actions)\nIt is shown here but not edited here"
process pApplied "Sentences from actions applied on the case page are part of their sections\ne.g. 'Step-down plan: ...' and 'Sertraline was started on 9/21.'"
process pNote "A draft Payers redrafted after a payer change shows one line above the summary\n'Updated for a payer change on 10/20'"
process pHead "The second heading follows the level of care\n'Why a lower level of care is not safe' (Residential 3.5, PHP)\n'Why weekly outpatient care is not enough' (IOP)\n'Why withdrawal needs medical monitoring' (Detox)"
screen sChance "Approval chance card\nRing and 'Strong · likely 83-92%'\n'Summit usually decides in about 1.5 days. Based on 1,248 similar cases.'\nWhen the case does not meet what the payer asks for: 'Held back 3 points: 1 thing the payer asks for is not met.'"

group gChip "Source chips"
  click cChip "Click a chip under a section\nFor example 'Psychiatric eval p.3'"
  process pChips "Chips appear only for documents that are in the case\nThe 'Medication list' chip needs a sertraline answer"
  overlay oSrc "Document drawer\nTitle is the document's name, page 1 of 3\nThe cited passage is boxed under 'Evidence'"
  click cCloseSrc "Press Escape or close the drawer"
endgroup

group gEdit "Edit the summary"
  click cEdit "Click 'Edit' on the summary card"
  overlay oEdit "Each section becomes a text box under its heading\nHeader buttons 'Cancel' and 'Save changes'"
  input iText "Change the text of any section"
  click cCancel "Click 'Cancel'"
  process pCancel "Edits dropped; the summary is shown again"
  click cSave "Click 'Save changes'"
  store stNarr "Summary saved on the draft as edited\nThe case page's Draft tab now reads this text"
  agent aInt "Integrity re-checks the edits (demo: simulated)\nChecks show 'Re-checking' for about 1 second\n'Sign and send' is off meanwhile"
  decision dEmpty "Is any section empty?"
  toast tOk "'Integrity re-checked your edits'\n'Every sentence still traces to the chart.'"
  toast tEmpty "'Integrity re-checked your edits'\n'One section is empty, so signing is blocked.'"
  process pEmpty "The empty section reads 'This section is empty.' in red\n'Every sentence traced to the chart' turns Blocked"
endgroup

process pLost "Edits are lost when the summary is rebuilt\nAfter a new answer, a tick in 'To raise it further', 'Send back to Scribe', or a change to the medical records"

click cBack "Click 'Back'"
process pBack "Back to step 3 'Agents work'\nThe finished agents are shown again; nothing re-runs"
click cSaveD "Click 'Save as draft'"
toast tSaved "'Draft saved'\n'R-1701 is in Case Manager, ready to sign.'"

goto gVal "Continues in: Review and sign › Validation summary and checks"
goto gSign "Continues in: New case › Review and sign › Sign and send"
goto g36 "Continues in: Agents work › Finished, paused or left"
goto g39 "Continues in: New case › Save as draft and leave"
goto gDraft "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Draft › Read and edit"

s1 --> sc
sc --> sL & sR & sF
sL --> sNarr --> pHead
sL --> gVal
sR --> sChance
sR --> gVal
sR --> gSign

sNarr --> pCtx
sNarr --> pApplied
sL --> pNote
sNarr -.-> gDraft
sNarr --> cChip --> pChips --> oSrc --> cCloseSrc
sNarr --> cEdit --> oEdit --> iText
iText --> cCancel --> pCancel
iText --> cSave --> stNarr --> aInt --> dEmpty
dEmpty -->|No| tOk
dEmpty -->|Yes| tEmpty --> pEmpty
stNarr -.-> pLost

sF --> cBack --> pBack --> g36
sF --> cSaveD --> tSaved --> g39
